# 🚀 NEW: Ignore the images in the local Flutter project
# Uses `assets/images/*` (not `assets/images/`) so specific files can be
# re-included below — git's own rule "cannot re-include a file if a
# parent directory is excluded" applies only to excluded directories,
# not to excluded contents.
assets/images/*
# ...but keep the ones we bundle through pubspec.yaml — they need to be
# in git or the CI's fresh checkout will fail `flutter build web` with
# "No file or variants found for asset". These MUST match the entries
# under `flutter.assets` in pubspec.yaml (plus any others that the
# launcher-icons / native-splash generators read at pipeline time).
!assets/images/hero_yaounde.jpg
!assets/images/logo.png